# Class Practice Programs (Java)

These programs were developed in class by the professor, and I coded them alongside him as part of the lessons.

They are practice exercises to help me understand Java concepts, not original projects.

Included topics:
- Methods and modular programming (Payroll)
- Arrays (multiple versions showing progression)
- Loops and conditionals
- User input and basic calculations

Each version reflects what we were learning at the time and helped reinforce core Java fundamentals.
